guide forever/class/warlock/felhunter-horde
title Felhunter (Horde)
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
faction Horde
levels 30-33
zone The Barrens
keywords Summon Felhunter, Tome of the Cabal, Seeking Strahad, Strahad Farsan, Jorah Annison, Moldy Tome, Tattered Manuscript, Rod of Channeling, The Binding, Warlock, class pet
reward spell 691 "Summon Felhunter"
reward item 22244
why The felhunter, the demon to bring against spellcasters, and a Box of Souls for your shards.

# The felhunter for Horde warlocks: Seeking Strahad (2996 from Gan'rul
# Bloodeye, or 3001 from Carendin Halgar) to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, Tome
# of the Cabal (1801, 1803, 1805) with Jorah Annison in the Undercity, and The
# Binding (1795) back in Ratchet.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0
# and Questie-Forever) for the givers, the tome, the chest, the rods and the
# summoning circle; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): the chain is unchanged in
# Forever and The Binding pays a Box of Souls.
# Gan'rul's and Carendin's Seeking Strahad exclude each other; the guide sends
# Orcs and Trolls to Gan'rul and the Undead to Carendin.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, and the chain starts at 30, so it has not been checked in game.

step Seeking Strahad (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 30 Gan'rul Bloodeye, in the Cleft of Shadow under the Valley of Strength, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 2996                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye

step Seeking Strahad (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 30 Carendin Halgar, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 30
  accept 3001                         -- Carendin Halgar

step Strahad Farsan
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Ratchet; Strahad Farsan stands on the hill in town.
  turnin 2996 only Orc,Troll          -- Strahad Farsan
  turnin 3001 only Undead             -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1801

step Jorah Annison
  zone Undercity
  tip Jorah Annison stands in the Magic Quarter.
  turnin 1801                         -- Jorah Annison
  accept 1803

step Moldy Tome
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Moldy Tome lies on the shore west of Southshore, past the Torn Fin murloc camps.
  collect 6931 quest 1803.1           -- Moldy Tome

step Tattered Manuscript
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The Damaged Chest lies in the canyon north of Freewind Post.
  collect 6997 quest 1803.2           -- Tattered Manuscript, in the Damaged Chest

step Jorah Annison
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1803                         -- Jorah Annison
  accept 1805

step Rods of Channeling
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Dragonmaw Bonewarders and Shadowwarders hold the hills east of the road through the Wetlands: the rods drop from them.
  collect 6930 quest 1805.1           -- Rods of Channeling

step The Binding
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Use the Tome of the Cabal on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the felhunter to bind it.
  turnin 1805                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1795
  use 6999 @62.6,35.3                 -- Tome of the Cabal
  kill 6268 quest 1795.1              -- Summoned Felhunter
  turnin 1795                         -- Strahad Farsan: he binds the felhunter to you
